---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import RequirementBuilder from '../components/RequirementBuilder.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Start a requirement — InfraHub Desk"
  description="Describe an infrastructure requirement or build a concise technical brief before continuing with an InfraHub advisor."
  canonicalPath="/lets-talk"
>
  <div class="desk-page">
    <section class="desk-intro">
      <div class="container intro-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Bring us the requirement.</h1>
          <p>You do not need a provider shortlist or finished bill of materials. Start with the problem, location, capacity, or constraint you already know.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="desk-principles" aria-label="InfraHub inquiry principles">
          <div><dt>Before contact</dt><dd>Build a useful brief</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Clarification</dt><dd>One useful question at a time</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Commercial role</dt><dd>Confirmed before any introduction</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="desk-builder">
      <div class="container"><RequirementBuilder /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="desk-after" aria-labelledby="after-heading">
      <div class="container after-grid">
        <div>
          <h2 id="after-heading">What happens next</h2>
          <p>InfraHub reviews the requirement, identifies what still matters, and compares suitable technical routes. Where a partner-delivered service fits, we coordinate the introduction.</p>
        </div>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span><strong>Clarify</strong><p>Resolve the detail that changes the architecture.</p></li>
          <li><span>02</span><strong>Compare</strong><p>Evaluate suitable approaches and specialist capability.</p></li>
          <li><span>03</span><strong>Introduce</strong><p>Set the technical and commercial handoff clearly.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="container commercial-note">
        <strong>Commercial transparency</strong>
        <p>Provider-specific pricing, contracting, delivery, availability, and service commitments are confirmed with the selected provider. InfraHub clarifies its role before an introduction.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .desk-page { background: var(--bg-secondary); }
  .desk-intro { padding: clamp(72px, 10vw, 132px) 0 clamp(58px, 8vw, 96px); background: #0b1120; color: #fff; }
  .intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, .75fr); gap: clamp(48px, 8vw, 112px); align-items: end; }
  .desk-intro h1 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -0.04em; max-width: 9ch; text-wrap: balance; }
  .desk-intro p { max-width: 58ch; margin-top: 24px; color: #c4cfdd; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.65; }
  .desk-principles { margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid #2d3a50; }
  .desk-principles div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2d3a50; }
  .desk-principles dt { color: #8fa1ba; font-size: .8rem; }
  .desk-principles dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
  .desk-builder { padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px) 0; }
  .desk-after { padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px) 0; background: var(--bg-primary); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .after-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(52px, 9vw, 120px); }
  .after-grid h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.05; }
  .after-grid > div p { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; max-width: 50ch; }
  .after-grid ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .after-grid li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 120px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); align-items: baseline; }
  .after-grid li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .after-grid li span { color: var(--accent-blue); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .78rem; }
  .after-grid li p { color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; }
  .commercial-note { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .3fr) minmax(0, .7fr); gap: 32px; margin-top: 72px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .commercial-note p { color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 72ch; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .intro-grid, .after-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .desk-intro h1 { max-width: 10ch; }
    .after-grid li { grid-template-columns: 32px 90px 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .commercial-note { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .after-grid li { grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; }
    .after-grid li p { grid-column: 2; }
  }
</style>
